e Grace Imperium has accepted our terms. They surrender.",0,""],["ctl","avg2_985","a","004",null,null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["say","avg2_985","Albedo has entered Philae with the Seal of Grace. I will accept their formal submission at your palace in the Gold District.",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg2_985","a","008","music",null,-0.35,1.5,null,null,"Linear",0.3],["say","avg2_985","Your vision of universal tranquility has finally come true. Philae, Flavio, Sailstead, Goldfinch, Emor... Everywhere we rule, the citizens are well tended by the Intelligent Plants.",0,""],["ctl","avg2_985","a",null,"happy",null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["say","avg2_985","Heh... Everything is unfolding exactly as you willed it. I have never seen such happiness on their faces.",0,""],["w",0.5],["show","avg3_100","c","002",null,null,null,0,null,0.0],["mrt",1,"z","002","speechless",null],["say","avg3_100","...",1,""],["mrt",0,"z","002",null,"JuGong"],["say","avg3_100","You've done well, Darcia. Go. Secure the final Seal of Grace.",1,""],["mrt",3,"z",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["se","se_074"],["ctl","avg2_985","a","004",null,null,0.0,1.0,1.0,null,"Linear",0.3],["say","avg2_985","Yes, Your Majesty.==W== Soon... Soon we will return to when you could still hold me.",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg2_985","a","008","happy",null,null,null,null,"JuGong1","Linear",0.5],["goon"],["w",0.5],["bgm",""],["se","se_094"],["ctl","avg2_985","a",null,null,0.55,null,null,0.0,null,"OutSine",0.5],["w",0.5],["trn",0,0,false,false,1.0],["w",2.0],["trn",1,0,false,false,1.0],["w",1.0],["stg",0,60.0,0.0,null,"Linear",0.5,null,null,null],["w",0.5],["show","avg1_110","c","009",0.4,null,null,0,null,0.0],["se","se_062"],["ctl","avg1_110","c",null,null,0.45,null,null,1.0,null,"Linear",0.5],["w",0.5],["say","avg3_999","So, Boss. Is this the world you wished for?",0,""],["w",0.5],["show","avg3_100","c","002",null,null,null,0,null,0.0],["bgm","m6"],["mrt",1,"z","002",null,"chijing"],["say","avg3_100","No. Not even close.",1,""],["mrt",0,"z","002","sigh",null],["say","avg3_100","This isn't the world I wanted. It's just one that is slightly less terrible.",1,""],["mrt",3,"z",null,null,null],["w",0.8],["ctl","avg1_110","c","009","question",null,null,null,1.0,null,"Linear",0.5],["w",0.5],["say","avg1_110","Hard to admit? Everyone seems happy enough under the care of the plants...==W== Is this not the best possible ending?",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_110","c","008","happy",null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["goon"],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_110","c","003",null,null,null,null,null,"niunie1","Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_110","Your people are still obsessed with developing new Intelligent Plants, it seems. Giving everyone a \"plant partner\" that won't ever betray them. It's scary how dependent people are getting on those things.",0,""],["w",0.5],["show","avg3_100","a","002",null,null,null,0,null,0.0],["mrt",1,"z","002",null,null],["say","avg3_100","True. Give it time, and humans will be nothing more than museum exhibits, protected like an endangered species. We'd have everything, but still feel hollow.",1,""],["say","avg3_100","It might feel like happiness for a while,==W== but strip away a person's purpose for too long, and eventually, they'll lose their mind.",1,""],["w",0.5],["se","se_112"],["mrt",0,"z","002",null,"chijing"],["goon"],["mrt",3,"z",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_110","c","010","sigh",null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_110","You sacrificed so much. You built such a powerful army. Is this really all you have to show for it?",0,""],["w",0.5],["show","avg3_100","c","002",null,null,null,0,null,0.0],["mrt",1,"z","002","speechless",null],["say","avg3_100","They call me the Tyrant, but I'm just a person. There's a limit to what one human can do. I know that better than anyone.",1,""],["mrt",0,"z","002","question",null],["say","avg3_100","I'm sure you realize that, too. You're only standing here right now because others helped you get this far, aren't you?",1,""],["mrt",3,"z",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_110","c","012",null,null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_110","I never expected the Grace Imperium to die for me. Three of the Tetrad Aspects fell... Even Angie ambushed Darcia at the surrender ceremony, just to buy me time.",0,""],["se","se_251"],["ctl","avg1_110","c","017",null,null,null,null,null,"chijing","Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_110","And your friends, Boss... No matter how hopeless it looked, they never gave up. They kept fighting, desperate to save you.",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_110","c","011",null,null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_110","I came here to kill you without telling them. When I get back... They'll probably hate me for the rest of their lives.",0,""],["w",0.5],["show","avg3_100","c","002",null,null,null,0,null,0.0],["mrt",2,"z","002",null,null],["say","avg3_100","The New Star Guild, Petal Bloom, the Ashwind Clan... Are they alright?",1,""],["mrt",3,"z",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_110","c","012","speechless",null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_110","...",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_110","c","010",null,null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_110","Some ...==W== were lost before they ever got to see their dreams come true.",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_110","c",null,null,null,null,null,0.0,"JuGong","OutSine",0.5],["w",0.5],["se","se_226"],["obj","qstory_main_06_017",0,null,null],["w",0.5],["goon"],["ctl","avg1_110","c","011",null,null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.0],["w",0.5],["show","avg3_100","c","002",null,null,null,0,null,0.0],["mrt",1,"z","002",null,null],["say","avg3_100","I see... Thank you for being honest.==W== I've got no regrets left, then. Do it.",1,""],["w",0.5],["mrt",0,"z","002","happy",null],["goon"],["objx"],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_110","c","011",null,null,null,null,1.0,null,"Linear",0.5],["stg",0,null,null,null,"Linear",1.0,null,null,"Zhong"],["mrt",0,"z","002","exclamation",null],["say","avg3_100","Come on, Firenze. Pick up your sword.",1,""],["mrt",3,"z",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["se","se_055"],["ctl","avg1_110","c","017",null,null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["w",0.5],["say","avg1_110","...",0,""],["w",0.5],["show","avg3_100","c","002",null,null,null,0,null,0.0],["mrt",1,"z","002","question",null],["say","avg3_100","Firenze. Since when did you get so soft?",1,""],["mrt",0,"z","002",null,null],["say","avg3_100","We're both backed into a corner here. There's only one way out now: one of us lives, and the other dies.",1,""],["mrt",0,"z","002","speechless",null],["say","avg3_100","The four-year cycle is up. The Intelligent Plants are hitting their lifespan limits; they'll die in droves. Once I'm gone...",1,""],["mrt",3,"z",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_110","c","010",null,null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_110","Darcia won't be able to rebuild the army, and her plan falls apart. I get it...==W== I'm sorry, Boss. And thank you.",0,""],["w",1.0],["se","se_077"],["ctl","avg1_110","c","017",null,null,null,null,1.0,"JuGong2","OutSine",0.5],["goon"],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_110","c","012","speechless",null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_110","If our souls ever meet again...==W== I hope we can just be friends.",0,""],["bgm",""],["w",1.0],["ctl","avg1_110","c","011",null,null,null,null,1.0,"chijing","OutSine",0.5],["goon"],["w",0.5],["se","se_074"],["ctl","avg1_110","c","014",null,null,-0.6,1.8,null,null,"OutCubic",0.5],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_110","c",null,null,null,null,null,0.0,"JuGong2","Linear",0.5],["se","se_405"],["stg",0,null,null,null,"Linear",1.0,null,null,"Zhong"],["w",0.5],["trn",0,0,true,false,0.5],["w",0.5],["bg","white_room_inside_a",0,2.0],["w",2.0],["stg",0,0.0,0.0,1.0,"Linear",1.0,null,null,null],["w",1.0],["trn",1,0,false,false,1.5],["bgm","m54"],["w",0.15],["head","??:??, ? Month ?th, ????, White Room"],["w",0.5],["se","se_251"],["mrt",2,"z","016",null,null],["say","avg3_100","Ugh... My arms... They won't move. My whole body feels locked up stiff.",1,""],["mrt",3,"z",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["show","avg3_173","a","002",0.7,null,null,0,null,0.0],["ctl","avg3_173","a","011","attention",0.5,null,null,1.0,"jushou2","Linear",0.5],["say","avg3_173","My, my. Awfully fragile for a Tyrant. One little timeout and you're already falling to pieces?",0,""],["w",0.5],["show","avg3_174","a","013",0.3,null,null,0,null,0.0],["se","se_074"],["ctl","avg3_174","a",null,null,0.35,null,null,1.0,null,"Linear",0.5],["ctl","avg3_173","a","006",null,0.65,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["say","avg3_174","Don't be mean. It was four years. Here,==W== dear Tyrant, let me work on those muscles. We just need to rub out the stiffness and you'll feel better.",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg3_173","a",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.3],["ctl","avg3_174","a","008","music",null,-0.35,1.5,null,"jushou2","Linear",0.3],["goon"],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg3_173","a","007","attention",null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["w",1.0],["ctl","avg3_173","a","004","exclamation",null,-0.35,1.5,null,null,"OutSine",0.3],["say","avg3_173","I'm helping too! Hi-yah!",0,""],["w",0.5],["se","se_356"],["ctl","avg3_173","a","007",null,null,null,null,null,"niunie1","Linear",0.5],["w",1.0],["stg",0,null,null,null,"Linear",1.0,null,null,"Zhong"],["mrt",2,"z","007","flurry",null],["say","avg3_100","Gah—Ow, ow, ow! You're killing me!",1,""],["mrt",0,"z","015","attention",null],["say","avg3_100","Huh? The pain's actually gone.",1,""],["mrt",3,"z",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg3_173","a","008","music",null,null,null,null,"JuGong2","Linear",0.5],["say","avg3_173","Heh heh. That's my secret Finisher Massage technique. Learned it ages ago from a Loong.",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg3_174","a","006","sweaty",null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["say","avg3_174","It's called a \"Finisher\" but it heals... I don't get it.==W== Well, as long as you're getting better. You know, Tyrant, this time, you've truly lived up to the title.",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg3_174","a","002",null,null,null,null,1.0,null,"OutSine",0.5],["goon"],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg3_173","a","006",null,null,null,null,null,"niunie1","Linear",0.5],["say","avg3_173","Look at those humans. Content to live like zoo exhibits, pampered by Intelligent Plants...==W== I'll never understand how their minds work.",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg3_173","a","012","awkward",null,null,null,1.0,null,"OutSine",0.5],["goon"],["w",0.5],["mrt",1,"z","014",null,null],["say","avg3_100","Rich coming from you. You two seem pretty comfortable just loitering inside the Monolith yourselves...",1,""],["mrt",3,"z",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg3_174","a","003","speechless",null,null,null,null,"chijing","Linear",0.5],["ctl","avg3_173","a","006","speechless",null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["say","Virigia & Bernina","...",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg3_173","a","006",null,0.7,0.0,1.0,null,null,"Linear",0.3],["ctl","avg3_174","a","006",null,0.3,0.0,1.0,null,null,"Linear",0.3],["w",0.3],["ctl","avg3_174","a","005","music",null,null,null,null,"chijing","Linear",0.5],["say","avg3_174","My, aren't you sharp-tongued, Tyrant.",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg3_174","a","008","happy",null,null,null,null,"youchupeng","Linear",0.5],["say","avg3_174","That question's too deep for Bernina. Her brain is overheating. Let's just watch your final recording instead.",0,""],["w",0.5],["se","se_169"],["trn",0,1,true,false,1.0],["w",1.0],["stg",0,0.0,0.0,1.0,"Linear",0.0,null,null,null],["bg","story_main_be_04_002_FP",0,0.5],["w",0.5],["cbg",0,null,null,1.02,"Linear",0.0,null,null,null],["trn",1,1,false,false,1.0],["w",1.0],["cbg",0,null,null,1.0,"Linear",3.0,null,null,null],["w",0.5],["se","se_050"],["say","avg3_174","You look quite cute like this. Makes me want to squeeze you.",9,""],["w",0.5],["se","se_051"],["say","avg3_173","Hmph. A meanie like you belongs in bondage, Tyrant. You'd make an excellent \"nutrient\" for those plants.",9,""],["w",0.5],["se","se_169"],["trn",0,1,false,false,1.0],["w",1.0],["bg","white_room_inside_a",0,0.5],["w",0.5],["show","avg3_174","a","014",0.3,null,null,0,null,1.0],["show","avg3_173","a","008",0.7,null,null,0,null,1.0],["trn",1,1,false,false,1.0],["w",1.5],["mrt",1,"z","021","sweaty",null],["say","avg3_100","Ouch. Harsh... Sometimes I wonder if you two actually hate my guts.",1,""],["mrt",0,"z","010",null,null],["say","avg3_100","Never mind...==W== Vita, open the door.",1,""],["w",0.5],["mrt",0,"z","002","attention",null],["goon"],["mrt",3,"z",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["se","se_401"],["mrt",2,"z","002",null,null],["say","avg4_999","Your command is my will.",2,""],["mrt",3,"z",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["bgm",""],["se","se_299"],["w",0.3],["ctl","avg3_174","a",null,null,0.24,null,null,0.0,null,"OutSine",1.0],["ctl","avg3_173","a",null,null,0.76,null,null,0.0,null,"OutSine",1.0],["cbg",0,null,null,1.2,"Linear",2.0,null,null,null],["w",1.4],["bg","white_room_inside_b",0,0.5],["cbg",0,null,null,1.13,"Linear",0.0,null,null,null],["cbg",0,null,null,1.3,"OutSine",1.0,null,null,null],["trn",0,1,false,false,1.0],["w",1.0],["bg","story_main_05_012",0,1.0],["w",1.0],["se","se_169"],["trn",1,1,false,false,1.0],["w",1.5],["cbg",0,null,50.0,null,"OutQuad",0.6,null,null,null],["w",0.6],["se","se_077"],["say","avg2_985","Your Majesty. Please, accept my undying loyalty. Take this army and conquer this rotting Nova that betrayed you.",9,""],["w",0.5],["mrt",1,"w","009","think",null],["say","avg3_100","How do I choose...?==W== I can't just blindly accept her allegiance again. Not this time.",2,""],["w",0.5],["mrt",0,"w","012",null,null],["goon"],["mrt",3,"w",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["bg","BG_Black",0,0.0],["bg","story_main_01_037",0,0.0],["w",0.25],["se","se_401"],["fx",0,"fx_avg_speaking",0,2],["say","avg4_999","Tyrant, I advise you to make use of her loyalty.",0,""],["say","avg4_999","Her devotion is absolute. Pure and unadulterated.",0,""],["se","se_226"],["say","avg4_999","If you commanded her to take her own life, she would execute the command without hesitation.",0,""],["w",0.5],["mrt",1,"w","003",null,null],["say","avg3_100","No. I won't do that.",2,""],["mrt",0,"w","002","question",null],["say","avg3_100","If I abuse her loyalty, I'll become exactly what the legends say I am—a heartless Tyrant.",2,""],["mrt",0,"w","012","exclamation",null],["say","avg3_100","I choose the honorable path.",2,""],["mrt",3,"w",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["trn",0,0,true,true,0.9],["w",0.9],["fx",0,"fx_avg_speaking",1,2],["trn",1,0,false,false,1.0],["end"]]}